    "description": "Knowledge graph of Albert Camus's The Myth of Sisyphus: philosophers, works, concepts, archetypes, and the dialectical movement from the absurd through lucidity to revolt, freedom, and passion. Extracted from the source text by Claude (i2t project) following the schema convention from yoheinakajima/instagraph (entity types, relationship strings, color-coded). Source text: ~/Knowledge/rawtextMOS-camus.md.",
